WEBVTT

00:04:57.857 --> 00:05:01.523
And if Richard thought I was getting
in the ring with that camel,

00:05:01.547 --> 00:05:03.976
someone was smoking Bedouin high grade.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.182
(Laughter)

00:05:05.206 --> 00:05:08.976
So we got as close to it as possible,

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.342
and I'm going to share this.

00:05:10.366 --> 00:05:12.135
Chris, if you want to roll this film.

00:05:12.159 --> 00:05:13.413
Then I'm going to show you

00:05:13.437 --> 00:05:15.533
a little bit more
about the design of camels.

00:05:15.557 --> 00:05:16.938
Do you want to roll the film?

00:05:17.287 --> 00:05:19.342
(Adventure music)